  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: sync/async CSV creation, append, and positional insertion with generated serialization, temporary-file replacement or bounded-memory in-place writes, plus CSV and XLSX queries. Insert uses long logical row indexes and full validation. Quick append is optional. Existing-file writes support UTF-8/16/32 and stateless single-byte encodings. API changes remain possible.",
